      "description": "Watch Watford vs Hansa Rostock highlights and goals from Friendly on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on July 25, 2026. Pre-season preparations hit top gear as Watford hosted Hansa Rostock in a summer friendly on July 25, 2026. Both managers utilized the opportunity to rotate their squads and assess their tactical progress ahead of the new campaign. Dominant Display at Vicarage Road The match began with Watford looking to assert their authority on home soil. Throughout the first half , the Hornets controlled the tempo, carving out several chances and testing the Hansa Rostock defense. The German visitors struggled to maintain possession against a well-organized player group from the English side, who moved the ball with precision and intent. Second Half Control and Late Flourish As the second half progressed, the intensity remained high despite the typical flurry of friendly substitutions. Watford continued to dictate play, showing superior fitness and tactical awareness. While Hansa Rostock tried to find a way back into the sports contest, the home side remained disciplined and hungry for more. The definitive moment of the evening arrived in stoppage time. In the 91st minute, N. Chikovani found space in the box to slot home a clinical goal , sealing a comprehensive 3-0 scoreline. It was a perfect ending to a professional performance that suggests the Hornets are finding their form at exactly the right time."
